<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 680 0 R/Alt(Figure 2. Out-of-sample performance across technical benchmark architectures (N = 638 4-hour bars, June 3, 2026 to September 17, 2026) under a 10 bps transaction fee. The upper panel illustrates cumulative wealth trajectories W_t; the lower panel displays underwater drawdowns. Non-sequential tabular models (Logistic Regression and Random Forest) suffer severe capital erosion due to the Turnover Trap, whereas the 2-Layer Technical LSTM acts as a temporal low-pass filter, securing +12.33% net return.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1577 0 R>>
